/**
 * @defgroup StarAgmlChecker StarAgmlChecker — AGML Geometry Material-Budget Checker
 * @brief Analyses the assembled TGeo geometry for material budget and checksum consistency.
 * @ingroup StarAgmlLib
 *
 * `StarAgmlChecker` operates on a fully assembled `TGeoManager` geometry
 * produced by `StarTGeoStacker` and provides two services:
 *
 * 1. **Material-budget mapping** — fires rays from the origin through the
 *    geometry and integrates the radiation length X/X₀ of traversed media as a
 *    function of pseudorapidity η and azimuthal angle φ.  Results are returned
 *    as a `TObjectSet` of 2D histograms, one for the requested top volume and
 *    one per direct daughter.
 *
 * 2. **Geometry checksums** — computes deterministic MD5 digests of TGeo
 *    volume sub-trees (shape parameters, material/medium properties, placement
 *    matrices, node connectivity) for regression testing and change detection.
 *
 * @par Related modules
 * - @ref StarAgmlLib   — core AGML geometry description library
 * - @ref StarAgmlUtil  — coordinate transforms and parameter utilities
 * - @ref StarAgmlViewer — interactive geometry visualisation
 *
 * @{
 */

/**
 * @class StarAgmlChecker
 * @brief Extends TGeoChecker with AGML-specific material-budget and checksum analysis.
 * @ingroup StarAgmlChecker
 *
 * Constructed with a pointer to the active `TGeoManager` and an optional flag
 * controlling whether air-equivalent media contribute to the material budget
 * integrals (`scoreAir`, default true).
 *
 * Key methods:
 * - `MaterialPlot(top, nEta, mnEta, mxEta, nPhi, mnPhi, mxPhi, rmin, rmax, zmin, zmax, opts)`
 *   — integrate radiation lengths in (η,φ) bins within the specified cylindrical
 *   and longitudinal bounds.  Returns a `TObjectSet` of `TH2` histograms.
 * - `CheckSum(volume)` — MD5 digest of the named volume sub-tree.
 * - `CheckSet(volume)` — `TDataSet` tree mirroring the TGeo hierarchy with each
 *   node replaced by its checksum string.
 * - `Skip(vol)` — exclude a named volume (and its descendants) from analysis.
 */

/**
 * @class CheckSum_t
 * @brief Typed MD5 accumulator for deterministic geometry checksums.
 * @ingroup StarAgmlChecker
 *
 * Feeds typed values (Int_t, Float_t, Double_t, TString, etc.) into an
 * incremental `TMD5` digest via `operator+=`.  Implicit conversion to `TMD5`,
 * `TString`, or `const char*` finalises and returns the digest.  Used
 * internally by `StarAgmlChecker` to hash each TGeo shape, material, medium,
 * matrix, and node.
 */

/**
 * @}
 */
